# ── GitHub Linguist overrides ──
# Mark non-Python assets so GitHub shows Python as the primary language.

# Sphinx / docs source
source/**            linguist-documentation
*.md                 linguist-documentation
*.rst                linguist-documentation

# Saved reference papers (HTML/JS/CSS)
**/papers/**         linguist-vendored

# Static assets for Sphinx theme
source/_static/**    linguist-vendored

# Assembly output files
*.s                  linguist-generated
